    {
        "text": "Silent. Strange. Unfathomable. Outsider."
    },
    {
        "text": "So they naturally come to say."
    },
    {
        "text": "Shadowy. Cold-blooded. Leaves for dead. A born monster."
    },
    {
        "text": "So all will say behind my back."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "text": "One needs only lose one's home, and one is nothing at all."
    },
    {
        "text": "Reason says that I, coming here, should have been able to begin a new life."
    },
    {
        "text": "Except the past cannot be rid. These things follow your shadow and climb your shins, dragging you into the abyss of the swamp."
    },
    {
        "text": "Not one of us can break free of the past."
    },
    {
        "text": "If there comes a day, and your home has found you..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
