        "image": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$farce_intro",
        "key": "$farce_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "2:33 A.M. \\ Overcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island Landship, Hallway"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright! Once this report's handed in, your field mission will be formally closed out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, is it still... blank? Ahem, hm-hm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "The only thing on this entire sheet is the word 'complete!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "The mission definitely is complete.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I mean, that's not wrong...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "...but it wouldn't hurt if you wrote a little more, right?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "(What do I do... just how difficult is she?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I never really talked to her before. I heard we were linking up with her, and the group leader even warned me... but this is still going to be tricky to handle.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Deep breath)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, okay. I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the Doctor has any questions regarding the particulars of your mission, we'll seek confirmation from you again then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...The Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Dr. Kal'tsit presumed you wouldn't want to hand a report in to her... and she also mentioned Amiya's too soft on you, and it can't go on like this... and so on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "So then we filed this mission away on the Doctor's end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That woman. Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you want to report directly, then? Looks like the Doctor's out right now, so you can relax for a few days until the Doctor's back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "This report of yours, right now, could seriously use some more fleshing out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such a pain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, then. Mission code F1071, confirming submission. Follow-up specifics\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Give the files back to me. I've decided, it's okay if I add a few more details.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh! Of course it's okay! I'll leave it to you, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "(This might go smoother than I anticipated...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "That's all from me then. Do head back and get some proper... um?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#8",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Your expression just completely changed. Has something happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In likelihood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#8",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? In here? Aboard the ship? An intruder?! I've heard about your acute senses. Could it be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, that's not right. The alarms should have sounded if there was danger aboard, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Singing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#8",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Singing? What singing? Er, it's silent all around. I can't hear any...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How? Why is there singing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#8",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I suppose there is a sort of droning sound, but that's not a song, is it? There's all kinds of machinery operating aboard Rhodes Island. Is it their vibrations, just maybe? Are you still not fully used to it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_263_skadi#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No. The scent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "The scent of the seawater.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Skadi? You're scaring me a little. What are you tal...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Hey! Skadi!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_intro",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "text": "Skadi runs too hurriedly, too rapidly. She runs for the stairwell, fearing that those few seconds of apprehension riding the elevator will allow that scent to slip away."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "A hunter is walking on seacoast way\u266a",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "text": "She can hear the song. Aboard this ship, a vast majority cannot."
    },
    {
        "text": "This language, this melody, has roused her memories. She is not one for nostalgia, but she knows it all too well."
    },
    {
        "text": "But... this shouldn't be. This is a song that should not arise here."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "With homeland left a mile behind, they must lament and pray\u266a",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "text": "The singing shivers all throughout the ship's pipelines."
    },
    {
        "text": "The scent of seawater, breaking unbreakingly, seeps out from the cabin walls."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Skadi remembers this scent just the same. With the damp closed in on her, her skin continuously contracts, becomes taut. Nervous, yet she is stirred too."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could she have awoken? She cannot help but hasten her step."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Specter!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
