    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "(\u00c6girian) It's the rotted seagrass that clings most to one's leg.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never thought it would be the annoyance of worthless bounty hunters that remained ever unchanging.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
